{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/suburbia-damac-jebel-ali-freezone","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":325,"crm_id":"2288","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Suburbia","slug":"suburbia-damac-jebel-ali-freezone","display_address":"Jebel Ali Freezone","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Damac Properties","price":851000,"display_price":"851K","lattitude":24.9695941,"longitude":55.0856552,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Suburbia is a project by Damac Properties located in Jebel Ali Freezone neighborhood. The complex is an exclusive residential project consisting of two towers of 11 and 19 floors. It features studios, <strong>1-4 bedroom apartments</strong> and designer duplexes. Every detail of the interiors has been thought through to create the perfect blend of convenience and aesthetics, allowing you to immerse yourself in the atmosphere of Moroccan architecture.</p><p>Residents have access to a variety of services, including a modern sports field with state-of-the-art equipment, a temperature-adjustable swimming pool and a beautifully landscaped garden. Other key features of the complex include 24-hour security, walking and jogging paths and a sauna.</p><p>Due to the central location of the complex, residents will have easy access to many interesting places in the city, including the famous Jebel Ali, Dubai Parks, Ghantoot Racing &amp; Polo Club and the unique Ibn Battuta shopping center. The complex also connects to Sheikh Zayed Road, making it a 10-minute drive to Dubai Marina and Palm Jumeirah, while Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are approximately 20 minutes away. Dubai International Airport is no more than 35 minutes away.</p><p>Suburbia is a unique living space that offers comfort, security and coziness. It is a place where everyone can enjoy nature and a peaceful lifestyle despite the fast-paced world of modernity. The complex is ideal for couples with children, and investors can receive a stable income from renting out the property.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2288/images/2024/06/25/g57y6aQfyEE8fu31tudyz9xz24xwjRXd5eSujXho.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/25/g57y6aQfyEE8fu31tudyz9xz24xwjRXd5eSujXho.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2288/images/2024/06/25/nlQ0yLoLcGpFrQjtsiGP3lvbbTN2H1p1quymy3Mh.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/25/nlQ0yLoLcGpFrQjtsiGP3lvbbTN2H1p1quymy3Mh.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2288/images/2024/06/25/FfUYxcQJai9PMs6bTwCXFynqJXTyQ7W7kU4ajyyY.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/25/FfUYxcQJai9PMs6bTwCXFynqJXTyQ7W7kU4ajyyY.png","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2288/images/2024/06/25/wVO3lumwiLznRPDrVa5GAEtfnpqOVEJgkqiAfEG1.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/25/wVO3lumwiLznRPDrVa5GAEtfnpqOVEJgkqiAfEG1.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2330,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1568,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1629,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1630,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1631,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ce